WEBVTT

00:01.059 --> 00:03.956
<i>[upbeat ukulele music]</i>
<i>[欢快的尤克里里音乐]</i>

00:04.025 --> 00:09.991
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.059 --> 00:14.094
[baby cooing]
[婴儿咕咕声]

00:14.163 --> 00:15.163
- Oh!
- [laughing]
- 哦！
- [笑]

00:15.197 --> 00:18.266
[screaming]
[尖叫]

00:20.197 --> 00:21.646
I can't see!
我看不见！

00:21.715 --> 00:22.715
I can't see!
我看不见！

00:22.749 --> 00:25.301
[tires screech, both screaming]
[轮胎发出刺耳的声音，两人都尖叫]

00:25.370 --> 00:27.439
Mama! Papa! No!
妈妈！爸爸！不！

00:27.508 --> 00:30.404
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

00:30.473 --> 00:34.335
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

00:34.404 --> 00:39.335
[tires squeal, both screaming]
[轮胎发出尖叫声，两人都尖叫]

00:39.404 --> 00:43.680
Bikini Bottom's long-awaited
dynamite factory
比基尼泳裤期待已久
炸药厂

00:43.749 --> 00:45.956
is now open!
- Look out!
现已开放！
- 小心！

00:46.025 --> 00:47.887
Huh?
啊？

00:47.956 --> 00:50.577
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

00:50.646 --> 00:52.128
Oh, phew.
哦，唷。

00:52.197 --> 00:54.577
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

00:54.646 --> 00:57.473
Hey, Mrs. Puff, I can see
your house from up here.
Hey, Mrs. Puff, I can see
从这里看你的房子。

01:02.749 --> 01:03.749
Huh?
啊？

01:03.784 --> 01:06.853
<i>[quirky music]</i>
<i>[古怪的音乐]</i>

01:06.922 --> 01:08.404
[sighs]
[叹气]

01:08.473 --> 01:11.232
Look at that.
You saved me a commute.
看看那个。
你节省了我的通勤时间。

01:11.301 --> 01:13.542
Just let yourself out.
就让自己出去吧。

01:13.611 --> 01:16.301
Well, if you're sure...
好吧，如果你确定...

01:16.370 --> 01:17.991
See you tomorrow, Mrs. Puff!
明天见，普芙女士！

01:18.059 --> 01:20.853
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:20.922 --> 01:24.025
Maybe he really is unteachable.
也许他真的是不可教的。

01:25.439 --> 01:27.370
I give up.
我放弃。

01:27.439 --> 01:29.232
No, Puff, not yet.
不，普夫，还没有。

01:29.301 --> 01:31.370
You're a driving instructor!
你是一名驾驶教练！

01:31.439 --> 01:34.818
Instructing that boy
is your duty.
教导那个男孩
是你的职责。

01:34.887 --> 01:38.473
You just need a little guidance.
你只需要一点指导。

01:38.542 --> 01:40.128
<i>[calm music]</i>
<i>[平静的音乐]</i>

01:40.197 --> 01:43.646
[phone ringing, vibrating]
[电话铃声、振动]

01:43.715 --> 01:45.784
The universe greets you.
宇宙向你问好。

01:45.853 --> 01:49.059
Allow me to guide
your celestial vessel.
请允许我指导
你的天船。

01:49.128 --> 01:50.370
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

01:50.439 --> 01:51.956
driving...
驾驶...

01:52.025 --> 01:52.956
me...
我...

01:53.025 --> 01:54.818
crazy!
疯狂的！

01:54.887 --> 01:56.335
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

01:56.404 --> 01:58.577
Oh, Mrs. Puff.
哦，帕夫夫人。

01:58.646 --> 02:00.715
Perhaps it would help
也许会有帮助

02:00.784 --> 02:03.784
if you find a way to be
with SpongeBob
如果你找到办法
与海绵宝宝

02:03.853 --> 02:06.818
without being
with SpongeBob, hmm?
没有存在
和海绵宝宝一起，嗯？

02:06.887 --> 02:08.301
Okay.
好的。

02:08.370 --> 02:10.853
<i>Feel free to annoy me
for money again soon.</i>
<i>随意惹恼我
很快又要钱了。</i>

02:10.922 --> 02:11.853
<i>Goodbye.</i>
<i>再见。</i>

02:11.922 --> 02:14.749
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:14.818 --> 02:16.197
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:16.266 --> 02:17.715
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:17.784 --> 02:18.818
Ah...
啊...

02:18.887 --> 02:22.611
Less stress. <i>
[bell dings]</i>
压力较小。 <我>
[铃声]</i>

02:22.680 --> 02:28.439
Being with SpongeBob
without being with SpongeBob.
和海绵宝宝在一起
没有和海绵宝宝在一起。

02:28.508 --> 02:30.749
[groans]
But how?
[呻吟]
但如何呢？

02:30.818 --> 02:31.887
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:31.956 --> 02:33.784
[breathes deeply]
[深呼吸]

02:33.853 --> 02:35.646
[harmonious music plays]
Huh?
[和谐的音乐响起]
啊？

02:35.715 --> 02:38.956
Where is that music coming from?
那音乐是从哪里来的？

02:39.025 --> 02:41.025
A submarine?
潜艇？

02:41.094 --> 02:43.887
That gives me an idea.
这给了我一个想法。

02:43.956 --> 02:45.335
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:45.404 --> 02:48.335
[music continues]
[音乐继续]

02:48.404 --> 02:51.473
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:51.542 --> 02:53.266
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:53.335 --> 02:55.128
I knew it!
我就知道！

02:55.197 --> 02:59.887
Where there are sailors,
there are always potatoes.
有水手的地方，
总是有土豆。

02:59.956 --> 03:01.473
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:01.542 --> 03:04.439
<i>[mysterious music]</i>
<i>[神秘的音乐]</i>

03:04.508 --> 03:11.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:13.508 --> 03:16.577
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:19.059 --> 03:21.370
Huh? <i>
Qu'est-ce que c'est?</i>
啊？ <我>
Qu'est-ce que c'est?</i>

03:21.439 --> 03:25.542
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:25.611 --> 03:27.508
There.
That should do it.
那里。
应该可以做到这一点。

03:27.577 --> 03:28.617
- ♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
- Huh?
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪
- 啊？

03:28.680 --> 03:29.577
Gah!
- ♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
嘎！
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

03:29.646 --> 03:32.094
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:32.163 --> 03:34.128
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

03:34.197 --> 03:35.853
[grunts]
D'oy!
[咕哝]
哎哟！

03:35.922 --> 03:37.439
Oh, Mrs. Puff!
哦，帕夫夫人！

03:37.508 --> 03:40.128
It's been so long!
Did you miss me?
已经过去这么久了！
你想念我吗？

03:40.197 --> 03:43.542
<i>Oh, yes, SpongeBob.</i>
<i>哦，是的，海绵宝宝。</i>

03:43.611 --> 03:46.094
<i>I missed you so much.</i>
<i>我非常想念你。</i>

03:46.163 --> 03:48.404
It's so good to see you...
很高兴见到你...

03:48.473 --> 03:49.749
from here.
从这里。

03:49.818 --> 03:51.853
Ooh! Did you get a new hat?
哦！你买新帽子了吗？

03:51.922 --> 03:54.266
It really brings out
all your eyes.
它确实带出了
你所有的眼睛。

03:54.335 --> 03:55.887
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

03:55.956 --> 03:58.094
[laughs]
[笑]

03:58.163 --> 03:59.749
All right...
好的...

03:59.818 --> 04:03.301
Time to focus on the road,
my excellent little noodle.
是时候把注意力集中在路上了
我优秀的小面条。

04:03.370 --> 04:06.991
Oh! I must live up
to your noodle-spectations!
哦！我必须活下去
满足您的面条期望！

04:07.059 --> 04:09.094
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

04:09.163 --> 04:10.508
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:10.577 --> 04:11.646
How was that?
怎么样？

04:11.715 --> 04:15.577
That was very good.
那很好。

04:15.646 --> 04:18.335
<i>Okay, take a right here.</i>
<i>好的，在这里右转。</i>

04:18.404 --> 04:20.887
<i>Now keep going right.</i>
<i>现在继续向右走。</i>

04:20.956 --> 04:24.128
Feels right to me!
[laughs]
我觉得很对！
[笑]

04:24.197 --> 04:28.059
Ah, yes, it does.
啊，是的，确实如此。

04:28.128 --> 04:32.439
Now I can catch up
on my stories.
现在我可以赶上
关于我的故事。

04:32.508 --> 04:33.715
Oh, Dwayne.
哦，德韦恩。

04:33.784 --> 04:35.818
The only thing
I've ever loved...
唯一的一件事
我曾经爱过...

04:35.887 --> 04:38.646
[bell rings]
Is a skull-cracking smackdown!
[铃声响起]
是一记惊天动地的重击！

04:38.715 --> 04:40.335
[grunts]
[cheering]
[咕哝]
[欢呼]

04:40.404 --> 04:42.025
That's right!
这是正确的！

04:42.094 --> 04:43.611
<i>[static whirs]
- Keep going right?</i>
<i>[静电呼呼声]
- 继续吧？</i>

04:43.680 --> 04:45.508
All right. <i>
Um, yeah.</i>
好的。 <我>
嗯，是的。</i>

04:45.577 --> 04:47.025
<i>Sure, SpongeBob.</i>
<i>当然，海绵宝宝。</i>

04:47.094 --> 04:48.818
Boy, I really feel like
I'm getting the hang
男孩，我真的觉得
我正在掌握窍门

04:48.887 --> 04:50.508
of this turning-right thing.
这个右转的事情。

04:50.577 --> 04:54.646
Hey, this is the longest I've
ever driven without crashing.
嘿嘿，这是我最长的一次了
曾经开车没有撞车过。

04:54.715 --> 04:56.370
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

04:56.439 --> 04:59.611
Oh.
There's none left.
哦。
没有了。

04:59.680 --> 05:01.542
<i>[static whirs]
Left.</i>
<i>[静电呼呼声]
左。</i>

05:01.611 --> 05:04.301
Left?
But I'm still working on right.
左边？
但我仍然在努力。

05:04.370 --> 05:05.611
Do you really think I'm ready?
你真的认为我准备好了吗？

05:05.680 --> 05:07.784
<i>[static whirs]</i>
- Yeah!
<i>[静态呼呼声]</i>
- 是啊！

05:07.853 --> 05:10.025
Oh, okay, if you think so.
哦，好吧，如果你这么认为的话。

05:10.094 --> 05:13.128
[tires squealing, horn blares]
[轮胎尖叫声、喇叭声]

05:15.611 --> 05:17.128
Oh!
[chuckles]
哦！
[笑声]

05:17.197 --> 05:18.335
Sorry about that.
对此感到抱歉。

05:18.404 --> 05:19.473
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:19.542 --> 05:21.577
[tires squeal]
- Whoa!
[轮胎吱吱声]
- 哇！

05:21.646 --> 05:23.059
Huh.
呵呵。

05:23.128 --> 05:26.094
Some people will do anything
to use the carpool lane.
有些人什么都会做
使用拼车车道。

05:26.163 --> 05:27.266
Huh?
Uh-oh.
啊？
呃哦。

05:27.335 --> 05:30.404
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:30.473 --> 05:31.473
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:31.542 --> 05:34.577
[popcorn popping]
[爆米花爆开]

05:34.646 --> 05:37.094
[microwave beeps]
[微波炉嘟嘟声]

05:37.163 --> 05:41.266
<i>[grunting and cheering on TV]</i>
<i>[电视上的咕哝声和欢呼声]</i>

05:41.335 --> 05:42.335
<i>[horn honks]</i>
<i>[按喇叭]</i>

05:42.370 --> 05:44.301
Oh, SpongeBob?
哦，海绵宝宝？

05:44.370 --> 05:47.818
Your driving is immaculate.
你的驾驶完美无瑕。

05:47.887 --> 05:50.749
Just keep turning right.
继续右转即可。

05:50.818 --> 05:52.646
<i>Oh, I'm great at that.</i>
<i>哦，我很擅长。</i>

05:52.715 --> 05:54.439
[all giggling]
[大家咯咯地笑]

05:54.508 --> 05:57.542
[tires squealing, all screaming]
[轮胎吱吱作响，所有人都在尖叫]

06:00.956 --> 06:02.473
Wow!
哇！

06:02.542 --> 06:04.577
Whoa! <i>
[static whirs]</i>
哇！ <我>
[静态呼呼声]</i>

06:04.646 --> 06:06.542
<i>Keep that righty nice
and tight-y.</i>
<i>保持右手良好
和紧y。</i>

06:06.611 --> 06:08.715
Tightening my rightening.
收紧我的矫正。

06:08.784 --> 06:10.301
[alarm ringing]
[警报响起]

06:10.370 --> 06:14.128
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

06:14.197 --> 06:16.059
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

06:16.128 --> 06:19.439
This is the most fulfilling day
这是最充实的一天

06:19.508 --> 06:21.680
I've ever had as a teacher.
我曾经当过老师。

06:21.749 --> 06:23.025
Mmm.
[chokes]
嗯。
[窒息]

06:23.094 --> 06:24.818
[stoplight dings] <i>Bleh!</i>
[红绿灯叮当声]<i>天啊！</i>

06:24.887 --> 06:26.853
<i>[choking and coughing]</i>
- Uh-oh.
<i>[窒息和咳嗽]</i>
- 呃哦。

06:26.922 --> 06:30.680
Swallowed a bug, huh? <i>
[choking and coughing]</i>
吞了一只虫子吧？ <我>
[窒息和咳嗽]</i>

06:30.749 --> 06:32.197
<i>Attention all units...</i>
<i>各单位注意...</i>

06:32.266 --> 06:34.542
<i>major traffic violations
in progress.</i>
重大交通违法行为
正在进行中。</i>

06:34.611 --> 06:35.508
- [gasps] <i>
- Please pursue</i>
- [喘气] <i>
- 请追寻</i>

06:35.577 --> 06:36.680
<i>as fast as possible.</i>
<i>尽快。</i>

06:36.749 --> 06:38.646
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

06:38.715 --> 06:41.163
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:41.232 --> 06:42.542
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

06:42.611 --> 06:44.301
This must be an advanced lesson.
这一定是一堂进阶课。

06:44.370 --> 06:47.232
[tires squeal, sirens wailing]
- Huh?
[轮胎尖叫，警报器鸣响]
- 啊？

06:47.301 --> 06:49.577
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

06:49.646 --> 06:51.715
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

06:51.784 --> 06:54.922
Hey, that's him...
the jerk with the spud!
嘿嘿，就是他……
那个拿着马铃薯的混蛋！

06:54.991 --> 06:57.404
Let's get him, boys!
让我们抓住他吧，孩子们！

06:57.473 --> 06:59.577
Ooh!
[siren wailing]
哦！
[警笛哀号]

06:59.646 --> 07:02.956
[all growling]
[panting]
[全都咆哮]
[气喘吁吁]

07:04.680 --> 07:06.646
[siren wailing, tires squealing]
[警笛鸣响，轮胎尖叫]

07:06.715 --> 07:08.508
both: Ah!
两人：啊！

07:08.577 --> 07:11.197
This historic dynamite factory
这座历史悠久的炸药工厂

07:11.266 --> 07:15.094
has been open for one
entire day with no accidents.
已开放 1 个
一整天没有发生任何事故。

07:15.163 --> 07:17.577
Isn't that amazing?
[siren wailing]
这不是很神奇吗？
[警笛哀号]

07:17.646 --> 07:19.232
Huh?
啊？

07:19.301 --> 07:21.577
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

07:21.646 --> 07:24.025
<i>[static whirs]
- Breaker, breaker, Cabin Boy.</i>
<i>[静电呼呼声]
- 破坏者，破坏者，机舱男孩。</i>

07:24.094 --> 07:26.404
<i>Hard to port.</i>
- Oh, a 10-4, Mrs. Puff!
<i>难以移植。</i>
- 哦，10-4，普夫夫人！

07:26.473 --> 07:28.370
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

07:28.439 --> 07:30.611
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:30.680 --> 07:34.680
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

07:34.749 --> 07:37.163
I'm gettin' too old for this.
我已经太老了，不适合做这个了。

07:37.232 --> 07:39.266
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:39.335 --> 07:41.956
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

07:42.025 --> 07:44.542
<i>[climactic jazz music]</i>
<i>[高潮爵士乐]</i>

07:44.611 --> 07:47.197
[grunting and screaming]
[咕哝和尖叫]

07:47.266 --> 07:49.749
<i>We interrupt
"Headlocks and Heartbreaks"</i>
<i>我们打断
“头锁和心碎”</i>

07:49.818 --> 07:52.301
<i>with an emergency news bulletin.</i>
<i>带有紧急新闻公告。</i>

07:52.370 --> 07:54.818
<i>High-speed sponge
terrorizes Bikini Bottom</i>
<i>高速海绵
恐吓比基尼泳裤</i>

07:54.887 --> 07:56.404
<i>with potato prisoner...</i>
<i>和土豆囚犯...</i>

07:56.473 --> 07:59.508
<i>last seen pursued by
band of bandit bikers</i>
<i>最后一次见到的人是
一群强盗骑自行车的人</i>

07:59.577 --> 08:01.266
<i>along Kraken Avenue.</i>
<i>沿着 Kraken 大道。</i>

08:01.335 --> 08:04.404
<i>Who knows where
he may strike next?</i>
<i>谁知道在哪里
他可能会下一个攻击？</i>

08:04.473 --> 08:06.922
Wha...
世界卫生大会...

08:06.991 --> 08:09.784
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

08:09.853 --> 08:11.335
<i>My leg!</i>
<i>我的腿！</i>

08:11.404 --> 08:16.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:16.749 --> 08:19.749
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

08:19.818 --> 08:21.335
Gah! Hello?
嘎！你好？

08:21.404 --> 08:22.887
Hello?
你好？

08:22.956 --> 08:26.508
Oh, Neptune.
哦，海王星。

08:26.577 --> 08:28.404
Enough of this leisure wig.
这种休闲假发够了。

08:28.473 --> 08:32.163
Time for the pursuit wig!
是时候追求假发了！

08:32.232 --> 08:34.370
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:34.439 --> 08:37.163
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:37.232 --> 08:41.301
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:41.370 --> 08:42.715
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

08:42.784 --> 08:44.439
I'm a driving instructor,
我是一名驾驶教练

08:44.508 --> 08:47.128
and I'm commandeering
this vehicle!
我正在指挥
这辆车！

08:47.197 --> 08:49.853
I can dig it, mohawk mama.
我可以挖掘它，莫霍克妈妈。

08:49.922 --> 08:51.163
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:51.232 --> 08:53.680
[tire squeals, siren wailing]
[轮胎尖叫声，警报器哀号]

08:53.749 --> 08:54.991
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

08:55.059 --> 08:57.059
[wailing continues]
[哀号继续]

08:57.128 --> 08:59.887
[screams]
Turn around!
[尖叫声]
转身！

08:59.956 --> 09:01.646
Ooh, whatever you say!
呵呵，随你怎么说吧！

09:01.715 --> 09:03.128
Whoa!
哇！

09:03.197 --> 09:04.818
[laughing]
[笑]

09:04.887 --> 09:06.715
Phew.
唷。

09:06.784 --> 09:08.301
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

09:08.370 --> 09:09.853
Oh, dear.
哦亲爱的。

09:11.577 --> 09:14.715
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:14.784 --> 09:21.922
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:27.370 --> 09:31.094
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:31.163 --> 09:32.749
[gasps]
Mrs. Puff!
[喘气]
泡芙太太！

09:32.818 --> 09:34.611
You've been mashed!
你已经被砸烂了！

09:34.680 --> 09:37.818
[cries]
[哭声]

09:48.370 --> 09:49.887
Ahem.
咳咳。

09:49.956 --> 09:52.439
Huh?
She's alive!
啊？
她还活着！

09:52.508 --> 09:55.542
Oh, you sure are resilient,
Mrs. Puff.
哦，你确实很有韧性，
泡芙女士。

09:55.611 --> 09:59.128
From now on, SpongeBob,
I'll uphold my duty
从现在起，海绵宝宝，
我会恪守我的职责

09:59.197 --> 10:04.025
as your driving instructor
to keep you safe on the road.
作为您的驾驶教练
确保您在路上安全。

10:04.094 --> 10:05.094
Mm.
毫米。

10:05.128 --> 10:07.887
[grunts]
[all grumbling]
[咕哝]
[大家都在抱怨]

10:07.956 --> 10:12.128
<i>[hard rock music]</i>
<i>[硬摇滚音乐]</i>

10:12.197 --> 10:14.094
[gasps]
Wait a minute!
[喘气]
等一下！

10:14.163 --> 10:16.059
You're Puff the Tuff!
你就是凝灰岩！

10:16.128 --> 10:17.680
Will you sign my cast?
你愿意签下我的演员阵容吗？

10:17.749 --> 10:18.991
- Oh.
- I love you!
- 哦。
- 我爱你！

10:19.059 --> 10:20.853
- [laughing]
- What a legend!
- [笑]
- 多么传奇啊！

10:20.922 --> 10:23.473
Oh, hi, boys.
哦，嗨，孩子们。

10:23.542 --> 10:25.715
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

10:25.784 --> 10:28.404
Looks like you got things
under control here.
看来你有东西
在这里受到控制。

10:28.473 --> 10:30.232
Let's scram!
我们滚吧！

10:30.301 --> 10:32.232
[sighs]
I know the drill.
[叹气]
我知道演习。

10:32.301 --> 10:35.404
<i>[calypso instrumental]</i>
<i>[calypso 乐器]</i>

10:35.473 --> 10:38.335
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:38.404 --> 10:39.887
So...
所以...

10:39.956 --> 10:42.197
what are you in for?
你来干什么？

10:42.266 --> 10:44.163
[sighs]
[叹气]

[叹气]